  m_text: "Tags: \r\n\t- High fat / High calories \r\n\t- High protein\nHealth Advice:
    \r\nMost of the fat comes from butter & cream, swapping them for low fat \r\nGreek
    yogurt keeps the tang and creaminess while cutting fat and calories.\n\nPortions   
    Calories      Protein     Carbs      Fats\r\n      1 \t        468  \t      42g  
    \t   13g         28g\r\n      2 \t        936   \t      84g   \t   26g        
    56g\r\n      3          1404  \t      126g   \t   39g         84g\r\n      4         
    1872  \t      168g    \t   52g         112g\r\n      5          2340  \t     
    210g    \t   65g         140"
